WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.179
P4.1 · Forecast rules and deterministic replay

2
00:00:06.329 --> 00:00:10.639
Each forecast line follows a saved rule, replayed every time.

3
00:00:10.689 --> 00:00:14.958
When a figure moves, an input or a rule changed, and both are visible.

4
00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:22.379
The flow rules page lists every rule: account, cash flow category, timing and cadence.

5
00:00:22.429 --> 00:00:29.277
Receivables are collected by aging; payroll follows its twelve-month average; leases follow their schedule.

6
00:00:30.427 --> 00:00:33.635
The forecast replays those rules month by month.

7
00:00:33.685 --> 00:00:38.563
Drag the cutoff: actuals run off up to it, the budget takes over after it.

8
00:00:39.713 --> 00:00:44.170
Typing over a forecast line breaks the link between inputs and output.

9
00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:51.692
Next: P4.2  Ledger or open invoices

